  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Lucretia My Reflection**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Autoclave**: back after 28 archived shows (623 days) [2]\n- **Poltergeist**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- **Paid in Cocaine**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **MountainGoatsTheGreyKingAndTheSilverFlameAttunement** (recommended): matrix (soundboard mixed with audience mics); 21 songs; 100 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Vivaldi, banter - Shelved [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **MountainGoatsTheGreyKingAndTheSilverFlameAttunement**: taped by nyctaper; source: Soundboard + Audience Matrix [1]. Also: Soundboard recorded by Brandon Eggleston using Neumann KM-150s and Sound Devices 744t; Audio processed in Soundforge, tracked with CDWave, and encoded to FLAC and MP3 [1]",
